f"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Christian County came in under 90% of normal in November to December in 38 of 75 years since 1951, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 27% of normal in August to September and 120% in June to July. So far in 2026 the middle ran 183% of normal in March to April. Grid 23863 had its driest year in 1988 at 60% of normal.</p>"}
